              "text": "پھرتی — phurtī — \"agility; quickness\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "اس کھلاڑی میں بڑی پھرتی ہے۔ is khilāṛī meṅ baṛī phurtī hai. This player is very quick on his feet."
            },
