          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "پھرتی (phurtī) is inherited: CDIAL lists the Hindi cousin phurtī, \"activity\", under Sanskrit sphurati, \"darts, springs\" (CDIAL 13849)."
            }
